<!-- OBVR's controls card: the Full VR layout on five pages, by role (the
     weapon hand, the other hand, both). The words are OBVR's (user0 title,
     the five lines line0..line4, user2 and user3 the button labels); each
     page shows one drawing, the image tiles pic0..pic9 (page 1 to 5, the
     right-hander's then the left-hander's - tools/make-controls-drawings.py,
     under Data\Textures\Menus\OBVR), and pic10..pic15 an Index's on pages
     1, 3 and 5 (ui::ControlsCardDrawing), OBVR setting the shown one's alpha to
     255 and the others' to 0. The buttons report 9601 (Next / Start over)
     and 9602 (Close), and the hidden 9600 is the closing ID OBVR clicks once
     it has acted on a choice. -->
